0 // Description: Long, low 4 x 18 stud plank frame, small 4624/3641 wheels outside it on 4488 holders; fixed axles.
0 // Parts: 35 (all inside the grouped submodel long-plank-base.ldr)
0 // Wheels: 4 (rim + tyre pairs on two axles)
0 // Bounds LDU: x -58..58, y -44..23, z -180..180 (size 116 x 67 x 360)
0 // Front / bow towards -Z, -Y up. The whole base is one submodel reference: move it as one piece.
1 16 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 long-plank-base.ldr
0 NOFILE
